"""
ant-serve - Anthive REST API Server (Phase 2 - Enhanced Performance)

Serves single-cell expression databases via HTTP using FastAPI.
Scans data folder for .duckdb files and exposes them through REST endpoints.

Phase 2 Features:
- Connection pooling for DuckDB connections
- Enhanced caching (gene lists, metadata statistics)
- Better async handling
- Response compression
- Basic metrics

Usage:
    ant serve [--data-folder PATH] [--host HOST] [--port PORT]

Example:
    ant serve --data-folder ./data --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8080
"""

